   "cgs": 1e-11,
   "cgd": 3e-12,
   "note": "Toshiba 2SK184-GR input follower: GR-rank IDSS 2.6-6.5 mA, VGS(off) -0.2 to -1.5 V; card takes IDSS 4.5 mA, Vp -0.7 V -> BETA = IDSS/Vp^2 = 9.2 mA/V^2 (gm0 12.9 mS, datasheet |Yfs| 15 mS typ). Ciss 13 pF / Crss 3 pF. unverified: mid-rank values, LAMBDA assumed"
  },
  "2SK118Y": {
   "kind": "njf",
   "vto": -0.8,
