   "n": 1.0,
   "cgs": 1e-11,
   "cgd": 3e-12,
   "note": "Toshiba 2SK118-Y switching JFET (Q002/Q003/Q009): Y-rank IDSS 1.2-3.0 mA, VGS(off) -0.2 to -1.5 V; card takes IDSS 2 mA, Vp -0.8 V -> BETA 3.1 mA/V^2, Rds(on) at Vgs 0 = 1/(2 BETA |Vp|) = 200 ohm. Ciss 13 pF / Crss 3 pF. unverified: mid-rank values"
  }
